# THE REEVE'S BACK DOOR (rome, 2026-10-23). The middle of the hamlet had no
# way onto the West Road where the road runs down its east side: the Reeve's
# House stood one step from the Gorse Break with a wall between. A back door
# now. It takes no den ground: the two rooms it brings inside 22 steps of the
# Wood Gate, the North House and the Reeve's Loft, are both under a roof.

!region den

